# The faction picker (PickWin, "CHOOSE YOUR FACTIONS"), reached from the title screen through Start Game, the
# map, difficulty and rules menus (a Return each). It is opened by config_game, so this scene builds no map and
# stops at Cancel. Steps: the window as it opens; the mouse over a group picture (its bubble text); a list row
# chosen; Random (lines to every row) and Choose again; an arrow key and a letter key (the window ignores
# them); a row's arrow button, which opens a menu of factions, and one chosen from it; the Alien Crossfire and
# the custom groups; the menu left with Escape; the first group again; the mouse over a button (nothing
# happens); Escape (Cancel). Leave time after each step; the snaps take 2 s each.
